{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3095","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3095","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3095\",\"parent_revision\":\"9548fa6a209645bbf016f7e3cada25d08b7cf0bc1234211fec3cfb36a15a1f1b\",\"root_revision\":\"9548fa6a209645bbf016f7e3cada25d08b7cf0bc1234211fec3cfb36a15a1f1b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Docs\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: 2026-08-20\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe backlog_view MCP tool's docstring claims map=True responses are \\\"always under 2,000 tokens,\\\" but no code path in backlog_core/server.py, disclosure_handler.py, or disclosure_types.py enforces that. _handle_map() builds map_text from every OrdinalEntry with no truncation step. The guarantee appears to rely entirely on format_map_line()'s per-line title/preview character caps holding empirically, not an enforced budget gate.\\n\\nWhere observed: discovered during backlog item #3060's architecture design phase (2026-08-21), while evaluating map=True as a candidate mechanism for an over-budget-response hint fix.\\n\\nImpact: an agent that trusts the documented 2,000-token ceiling to decide whether a map=True call is safe to make without further budgeting could receive a larger-than-expected response on an item with many sections/entries, since nothing in the code actually caps map_text's size.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer reading the documentation**, I want to **docs/behavior mismatch: map=true's \\\"always under 2,000 tokens\\\" claim is unenforced** so that **documentation is accurate and trustworthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"82cfe1e7f33770fe684328b247530e00f471011cb1fe6fa120b1cf5f05157641\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABP84u1g\"}"}